  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "这个时候，众人都围绕在大火旁边，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At this moment, everyone was gathered around the great fire,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "忽然又开心的齐声欢呼，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "when suddenly they joyfully cheered in unison again,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "只是罗连头发乱作一团，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but Luolian's hair was tangled into a wild mass,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "手里抱着幼儿，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and he held the infant in his arms,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "犹如天神降临，从大火中奋身跑出。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "like a god descending, he dashed out of the blaze with all his strength.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "这个时候一个燃烧殆尽的屋梁，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Just then, a roof beam that had burned almost to ashes,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "突然从空中掉过下来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "suddenly fell down from above,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "声大如雷，火花四溅，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "with a thunderous crash, sending sparks flying everywhere,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "顿时罗连所在的地方，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and in an instant, the place where Luolian had been standing",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00338",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "就只有像珊瑚树似的红光火柱了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "was nothing but a red pillar of flame like a coral tree.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
